{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,240p' __issue_context__.json\"","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"body\": \"**Preferred gene-related syndrome label**\\nRNU12 - related minor spliceopathy disorder\\n\\n**Synonyms**\\ncraniosynostosis-anal anomalies-porokeratosis syndrome MONDO:0011287\\nCDAGS syndrome\\nspinocerebellar ataxia, autosomal recessive 33 MONDO:0859360 \\n\\n**Parent term (use [OLS](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols/ontologies/mondo), or your favorite ontology browser)**\\nhereditary disease, syndromic disease\\n\\n**Definition**\\nAbnormal splicing of pre-mRNA caused by variants in the RNU12 gene. This term captures the disease spectrum. The term includes craniosynostosis-anal anomalies-porokeratosis, also known as CDAGS syndrome, and spinocerebellar ataxia, autosomal recessive 33.\\n\\n\\n**Definition source (Please give PubMed ID, if applicable, in format PMID:#######)\\nPMID: 39802771\\n\\n**Children terms (if applicable)** Should any existing terms be re-classified as children underneath this new proposed term? \\ncraniosynostosis-anal anomalies-porokeratosis syndrome MONDO:0011287\\nspinocerebellar ataxia, autosomal recessive 33 MONDO:0859360\\n\\n**Your nano-attribution (ORCID) or URL for a working group**\\nhttps://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40060/\\n\",\n  \"comments\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach875FUee\",\n      \"author\": {\n        \"login\": \"vgitau\"\n      },\n      \"authorAssociation\": \"NONE\",\n      \"body\": \"Dear @sabrinatoro, I'm following up regarding the RNU12 request. Please let me know if you have any questions regarding the ClinGen preferred label and/or definition. \\n\\nBest,\\nVanessa \",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-02T16:08:52Z\",\n      \"includesCreatedEdit\": false,\n      \"isMinimized\": false,\n      \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n      \"reactionGroups\": [],\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9963#issuecomment-4178921374\",\n      \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach875GUFc\",\n      \"author\": {\n        \"login\": \"sabrinatoro\"\n      },\n      \"authorAssociation\": \"MEMBER\",\n      \"body\": \"Hi @vgitau. Thank you for checking in. \\nWe haven't had a chance to look at this issue yet, but we will absolutely reach out if we have questions. \",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-02T16:57:31Z\",\n      \"includesCreatedEdit\": false,\n      \"isMinimized\": false,\n      \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n      \"reactionGroups\": [\n        {\n          \"content\": \"THUMBS_UP\",\n          \"users\": {\n            \"totalCount\": 1\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9963#issuecomment-4179181916\",\n      \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"title\": \"RNU12 - related minor spliceopathy disorder\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9963\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
