{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_43","type":"agent_message","text":"There is an existing analogous `RNU4ATAC spectrum disorder`, so I’m going to mirror that curation style: create an RNU12 spectrum grouping term, add the requested child parentage, and add a missing RNU12 gene relationship/definition support where the child term currently lacks it. I also found an existing Orphanet RNU12 ataxia term, so I’ll include it under the spectrum rather than leaving it outside the new grouping."}}
